  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Some names of new tabs in some languages (esp Russian) made of two words.\n\nAnd those two-words tabs are shown in single line, leaving large padding on top and bottom, but pretty small on the sides.\n\n**Maybe it would be prettier to make it two-liner with small inter-line interval?**\n\nUnfortunately, we cannot just put \"new line\" character there on Crowdin, as those string shared across different places in UI, where \"\\n\" should not be used.\n\nSo, we need another, splitted instance of the string on Crowdin to implement this.\n\nIn French there is already two lines, but it has pretty large interval, overlapping with logo.",
